    - lineId: split_front-comms-aria
      textKey: narrative.split_front.comms-aria
      englishFallback: No. Recovering my memory does not give me authority over this
        city. The Commander chooses each verified action. Keep the base defended;
        I will preserve this transmission as evidence.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e44cd792e6c2343a5b12566519ff1441, type: 3}
